-transparent opacity-90\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-3.5 top-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/90 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-warm backdrop-blur-sm\">2<!-- --> report<!-- -->s</div></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-marigold-deep\">Nubra Valley — Diskit</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Sand dunes, double-humped camels, and the valley floor where the Shyok and Nubra rivers meet.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-faint\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ok\"></span><span>Reported yesterday</span></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/0 transition group-hover:ring-marigold/25\"></div></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"group relative block overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated shadow-warm transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-transparent hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/places/zanskar-chadar\"><div class=\"relative w-full overflow-hidden bg-paper-muted aspect-[4/3]\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.08]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"(min-width: 1024px) 33vw, 100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-24 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/45 via-black/5 to-transparent opacity-90\"></div><div class=\"absolute right-3.5 top-3.5 rounded-full bg-white/90 px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold text-ink shadow-warm backdrop-blur-sm\">1<!-- --> report</div></div><div class=\"p-5\"><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-ink transition-colors group-hover:text-marigold-deep\">Zanskar — Chadar Route</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">The frozen-river trek along the Zanskar gorge, walked only when the ice is thick enough to trust.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-2 text-xs text-ink-faint\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-ok\"></span><span>Reported 4 days ago</span></div></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/0 transition group-hover:ring-marigold/25\"></div></a></div></div><a class=\"mt-8 block text-center text-sm font-semibold text-marigold-deep hover:underline sm:hidden\" href=\"/explore\">Explore all places →</a></section><section class=\"mb-28\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><div class=\"mb-9\"><h2 class=\"font-heading t