0&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fkhardungla-slide-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fkhardungla-slide-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fkhardungla-slide-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fkhardungla-slide-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fkhardungla-slide-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fkhardungla-slide-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fkhardungla-slide-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-16 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/35 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\"><span>Photo</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint\">·</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint normal-case\">Obstruction</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Small rockslide 2km before the summit cafe, BRO already clearing it, one lane moving.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-faint\"><span>Reported by <!-- -->Stanzin Motup<!-- -->, local guide</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">Near Khardung La · <!-- -->Updated 2 hours ago</p></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/0 transition group-hover:ring-marigold/25\"></div></a></div><div class=\"w-72 shrink-0 sm:w-80\"><a class=\"group relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated shadow-warm transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-transparent ho