w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fpangong-sunrise-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fpangong-sunrise-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fpangong-sunrise-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fpangong-sunrise-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fpangong-sunrise-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-16 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/35 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\"><span>Photo</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint\">·</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint normal-case\">Weather</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Water was every shade of blue by 7am, dead calm, best light of the trip so far.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-faint\"><span>Reported by <!-- -->Deskit Yangzom<!-- -->, local guide</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">Near Pangong Tso · <!-- -->Updated 14 hours ago</p></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/0 transition group-hover:ring-marigold/25\"></div></a></div><div class=\"w-72 shrink-0 sm:w-80\"><a class=\"group relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated shadow-warm transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-transparent hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/observations/mock-obs-nubra-11\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden bg-paper-muted\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.08]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"320px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fnubra-dunes-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-16 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/35 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\"><span>Photo</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint\">·</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint normal-case\">Trail Condition</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Dune walk to the camel point is soft sand the whole way, good shoes recommended, not a hard walk.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-faint\"><span>Reported by <!-- -->Padma Angmo<!-- -->, local guide</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">Near Nubra Valley — Diskit · <!-- -->Reported yesterday</p></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/0 transition group-hover:ring-marigold/25\"></div></a></div><div class=\"w-72 shrink-0 sm:w-80\"><a class=\"group relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated shadow-warm transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-transparent hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/observations/mock-obs-nubra-diskit-12\"><div class=\"flex aspect-[4/3] w-full items-center justify-center bg-gradient-to-br from-marigold-soft/70 to-marigold-soft/20 p-6\"><svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" class=\"text-marigold-deep\"><path d=\"M12 3a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v6a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V6a3 3 0 0 0-3-3Z\"></path><path d=\"M19 11a7 7 0 0 1-14 0M12 18v3\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\"><span>Voice story</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint\">·</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint normal-case\">Weather</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Noticeably warmer than Leh, sunny all day, good valley for a rest day after the pass.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-faint\"><span>Reported by <!-- -->Padma Angmo<!-- -->, local guide</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">Near Nubra Valley — Diskit · <!-- -->Reported 2 days ago</p></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/0 transition group-hover:ring-marigold/25\"></div></a></div><div class=\"w-72 shrink-0 sm:w-80\"><a class=\"group relative block w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[28px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated shadow-warm transition-all duration-500 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] hover:-translate-y-1.5 hover:border-transparent hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/observations/mock-obs-zanskar-13\"><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] w-full overflow-hidden bg-paper-muted\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover transition-transform duration-700 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1)] group-hover:scale-[1.08]\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"320px\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=32&amp;q=75 32w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=48&amp;q=75 48w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=64&amp;q=75 64w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=96&amp;q=75 96w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=128&amp;q=75 128w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=256&amp;q=75 256w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=384&amp;q=75 384w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpicsum.photos%2Fseed%2Fzanskar-ice-1%2F1600%2F1000&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/><div class=\"absolute inset-x-0 bottom-0 h-16 bg-gradient-to-t from-black/35 to-transparent\"></div></div><div class=\"p-5\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\"><span>Photo</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint\">·</span><span class=\"text-ink-faint normal-case\">Snow / Ice</span></div><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Open water and thin ice reported near Tibb cave bend -- local guides rerouting groups around it.</p><div class=\"mt-3 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-ink-faint\"><span>Reported by <!-- -->Sonam Dorjay<!-- -->, local guide</span></div><p class=\"text-xs text-ink-faint\">Near Zanskar — Chadar Route · <!-- -->Reported 4 days ago</p></div><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 rounded-[28px] ring-1 ring-inset ring-white/0 transition group-hover:ring-marigold/25\"></div></a></div></div></section><section class=\"mb-28\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink sm:text-4xl\">What travellers are noticing</h2></div><div class=\"mt-9 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"group block h-full rounded-[24px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated p-6 shadow-warm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/observations/mock-obs-leh-2\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\">Mobile Signal</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink\">“<!-- -->Full bars in the main market and old town -- last strong signal before Khardung La.<!-- -->”</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-ink-faint\">Namgyal Angchuk<!-- --> · <!-- -->Updated 20 hours ago</p></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"group block h-full rounded-[24px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated p-6 shadow-warm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/observations/mock-obs-leh-3\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\">Parking Availability</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink\">“<!-- -->New taxi stand near the polo ground has space most mornings, fills up by 10am in season.<!-- -->”</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-ink-faint\">Rigzin Chorol<!-- --> · <!-- -->Reported yesterday</p></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"group block h-full rounded-[24px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated p-6 shadow-warm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/observations/mock-obs-pangong-tso-9\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\">Mobile Signal</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink\">“<!-- -->No signal at all along the lakeshore camps -- tell travellers to message people before Tangtse.<!-- -->”</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-ink-faint\">Deskit Yangzom<!-- --> · <!-- -->Reported 2 days ago</p></a></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><a class=\"group block h-full rounded-[24px] border border-border/70 bg-paper-elevated p-6 shadow-warm transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-warm-lg\" href=\"/observations/mock-obs-khardung-la-7\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-marigold-deep\">Weather</p><p class=\"mt-2.5 text-[16px] leading-relaxed text-ink\">“<!-- -->Sharp wind at the summit marker, most riders not staying more than ten minutes.<!-- -->”</p><p class=\"mt-4 text-xs text-ink-faint\">Jigmet Wangchuk<!-- --> · <!-- -->Reported 2 days ago</p></a></div></div></section><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)\"><section class=\"grain relative overflow-hidden rounded-[32px] border border-border bg-ink p-8 sm:p-14\"><div class=\"absolute -right-24 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-marigold/20 blur-3xl\"></div><h2 class=\"relative font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-paper sm:text-4xl\">Not a guidebook.<br/>A living record.</h2><div class=\"relative mt-10 grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-3\"><div><p class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-marigold\">01</p><p class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-paper\">Someone on the ground reports it</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/60\">A local guide or traveller notes a condition, snaps a photo, or records a quick voice update.</p></div><div><p class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-marigold\">02</p><p class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-paper\">A person checks it</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/60\">Every report is reviewed by a moderator before it ever reaches this site — nothing publishes automatically.</p></div><div><p class=\"font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold text-marigold\">03</p><p class=\"mt-3 font-semibold text-paper\">It ages, honestly</p><p class=\"mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/60\">We track how old each report is. When it gets old, we say so — and quietly ask the next person on the trail to check again.</p></div></div></section></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"mt-24 border-t border-border bg-paper-muted\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-[1.3fr_1fr_1fr]\"><div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"flex h-7 w-7 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-ink font-heading text-xs font-extrabold text-marigold-soft\">F</span><p class=\"font-heading text-lg font-bold text-ink\">Firsthand</p></div><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">What a place is like right now, from people who were actually there. Every report on this site passed a human review before it went live.</p></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-faint\">Explore</p><ul class=\"mt-3 space-y-2 text-sm text-ink-soft\"><li><a class=\"transition hover:text-ink\" href=\"/explore\">All places</a></li><li><a class=\"transition hover:text-ink\" href=\"/explore?has_photos=true\">Photos</a></li><li><a class=\"transition hover:text-ink\" href=\"/explore?has_voice=true\">Voice stories</a></li></ul></div><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-ink-faint\">About this data</p><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-ink-soft\">Reports come from local guides in the field and are checked by a moderation team before publishing. Nothing here is generated or estimated.</p></div></div><p class=\"mt-12 text-xs text-ink-faint\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> Firsthand. Built on real, moderated field reports.</p></div></footer><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/3s6nzrbk-8mnv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[22016,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2sdm29m4c_lji.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0adbus2dt59th.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/43rscqoq0d8v4.js\\\",\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3--59_9pb9wdm.js\\\"],\\\"\\\"]\\